<content>
  <section><title>Self Check</title>
<para>The table below shows the number of checkers and the number of moves needed to win a skipping game.</para>
<table>
  <tgroup cols="5"><thead/>
  <tbody>
    <row>
      <entry>Number of Checkers</entry>
      <entry>
        1
      </entry>
      <entry>
        2
      </entry>
      <entry>
        3
      </entry>
      <entry>
        4
      </entry>
    </row>
    <row>
      <entry>Number of Skips Needed</entry>
      <entry>
        2
      </entry>
      <entry>
        8
      </entry>
      <entry>
        18
      </entry>
      <entry>
        32
      </entry>
    </row>
  </tbody>
</tgroup></table>
<para>How many skips are needed with 6 checkers on each side?</para></section>
</content>
